WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.010 --> 00:01.710
[Disclaimer: Characters, locations, and all depicted events are fictional

3
00:01.730 --> 00:03.490
and for entertainment purposes only; viewer discretion is advised]

4
00:11.900 --> 00:13.160
We're both done with our schedules today.

5
00:13.390 --> 00:14.590
Wanna head out with me?

6
00:15.270 --> 00:17.200
Go have a word up there, just you two,

7
00:17.520 --> 00:18.960
so no one else can hear.

8
00:19.370 --> 00:20.520
And what does this mean?

9
00:20.680 --> 00:22.670
From now on, I'm not your fan anymore!

10
00:22.700 --> 00:23.840
Do whatever you want.

11
00:24.030 --> 00:25.200
Why the fuck are you telling me?!

12
00:27.890 --> 00:29.760
Your boy shoved mine into the pool!

13
00:29.800 --> 00:30.760
Where's the proof?!

14
00:32.310 --> 00:33.600
He spewed insults at me...

15
00:34.050 --> 00:35.320
He genuinely hates me.

16
00:36.060 --> 00:36.560
Whoa...

17
00:36.750 --> 00:37.800
Why are you here?

18
00:38.180 --> 00:39.160
I like you.

19
01:43.390 --> 01:44.390
Too soon...

20
01:57.490 --> 01:58.580
At least...

21
01:59.900 --> 02:01.380
something good came out of it.

22
02:04.350 --> 02:05.350
So it's good?

23
02:08.150 --> 02:08.770
It is, huh?

24
02:31.970 --> 02:32.650
Hey!

25
02:33.190 --> 02:33.840
Too soon!

26
03:28.240 --> 03:29.910
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

27
03:35.600 --> 03:37.280
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

28
03:43.000 --> 03:44.520
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

29
03:44.540 --> 03:46.230
♫I wanna let the world know, you wanna close it♫

30
03:46.250 --> 03:48.120
♫Just wanna tell you, I'm doing fine, fine♫

31
03:48.160 --> 03:50.060
♫You won't reveal it, but I won't conceal it♫

32
03:50.090 --> 03:51.860
♫Trust me, it's alright♫

33
03:51.880 --> 03:53.650
♫You do you♫

34
03:53.670 --> 03:55.550
♫You can love whoever♫

35
03:55.570 --> 03:57.750
♫But I like you forever♫

36
03:57.780 --> 03:59.010
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

37
03:59.030 --> 04:01.060
♫No pressure, no drama♫

38
04:01.080 --> 04:02.880
♫Hakuna Matata♫

39
04:02.900 --> 04:04.980
♫Just somebody who likes ya♫

40
04:05.000 --> 04:07.000
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

41
04:07.040 --> 04:08.500
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

42
04:08.520 --> 04:10.320
♫No pressure, no drama♫

43
04:10.340 --> 04:12.150
♫Hakuna Matata♫

44
04:12.170 --> 04:14.400
♫Just somebody who likes ya♫

45
04:14.420 --> 04:16.079
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

46
04:36.570 --> 04:38.520
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

47
04:39.370 --> 04:41.400
[Mr. Fanboy Series]

48
04:41.440 --> 04:43.840
[Episode 7: "Eye for an Eye"]

49
04:52.950 --> 04:54.240
Hey, why are you still here?

50
04:54.260 --> 04:55.400
People could see us.

51
04:56.040 --> 04:58.320
Well, I wanna walk you all the way to your room.

52
05:02.020 --> 05:02.750
Why?

53
05:03.150 --> 05:04.050
Don't you like it?

54
05:04.890 --> 05:06.320
A hot guy is walking you home.

55
05:10.020 --> 05:11.080
So delusional.

56
05:12.300 --> 05:13.480
So...

57
05:14.160 --> 05:15.360
do you like it?

58
05:17.990 --> 05:19.350
Well...

59
05:19.370 --> 05:20.860
There's still room in my heart,

60
05:21.270 --> 05:22.840
'cause I'm not into anyone else.

61
05:27.550 --> 05:28.840
Not as my fanboy, though.

62
05:29.900 --> 05:31.260
I already have so many.

63
05:32.720 --> 05:33.720
Be my...

64
05:33.740 --> 05:35.840
Don't you say "my boy,"

65
05:36.840 --> 05:38.760
or else I'll run away from you.

66
06:05.770 --> 06:07.320
People could see us.

67
06:07.710 --> 06:08.640
Forget them.

68
06:09.280 --> 06:11.090
I'm ready to leave it all for you.

69
06:15.250 --> 06:16.250
Delusional!

70
06:16.910 --> 06:17.840
Wan!

71
06:42.970 --> 06:43.970
Wan!

72
07:12.490 --> 07:13.880
Jay, what are you doing here?

73
07:14.860 --> 07:16.240
And what did you do?

74
07:16.570 --> 07:18.560
Your sister called me over to clean up after you.

75
07:19.080 --> 07:19.960
But hey...

76
07:19.990 --> 07:22.440
It's really bugging me. Can I ask you one question?

77
07:23.900 --> 07:24.560
What?

78
07:25.130 --> 07:28.240
That BL series' slow-motion scene earlier,

79
07:28.450 --> 07:30.040
what happened there?

80
07:40.570 --> 07:43.480
Oh my, I can tell. I have watched many BL series, indeed.

81
07:43.800 --> 07:45.440
You two...

82
07:45.460 --> 07:47.700
please do not let people catch you with that.

83
07:47.720 --> 07:50.280
Otherwise, rest assured,

84
07:50.360 --> 07:51.340
ThirdNine

85
07:51.360 --> 07:52.870
and RenjiWan's fans will definitely

86
07:52.890 --> 07:53.880
get you trending.

87
07:54.370 --> 07:56.000
"Trouble never comes alone..."

88
07:56.370 --> 07:58.240
Uh, what does it come with?

89
07:58.860 --> 08:00.360
That bastard, that is. A fucking problem.

90
08:00.480 --> 08:01.540
Hey, be nice.

91
08:02.860 --> 08:03.960
I'm sorry.

92
08:04.460 --> 08:05.500
So slick...

93
08:05.520 --> 08:07.800
And why did I do that?

94
08:09.850 --> 08:11.800
That is a must, Mr. Jay. You were correct on that.

95
08:15.010 --> 08:17.240
And what's up with you? Talk normally.

96
08:18.970 --> 08:20.030
Certainly, dear Wan.

97
08:20.050 --> 08:21.420
Right away.

98
08:21.950 --> 08:23.370
Uh, Third,

99
08:23.390 --> 08:25.160
this is my true self,

100
08:25.270 --> 08:27.360
but the person you are about to witness is not.

101
08:30.240 --> 08:32.340
You were upset about Nine and fucking vanished.

102
08:32.360 --> 08:33.480
You scared me, bastard!

103
08:36.049 --> 08:37.480
So why didn't you call?

104
08:37.590 --> 08:38.940
I did, but you didn't fucking pick it up!

105
08:38.960 --> 08:40.640
I called Jay over because you disappeared.

106
08:40.669 --> 08:42.440
What kind of food takes you two to three fucking hours to find?

107
08:42.470 --> 08:44.810
I thought you were diving for fish in the Chao Phraya River.

108
08:44.830 --> 08:45.880
Don't even try it.

109
08:45.900 --> 08:47.420
It's a hassle booking a temple for a funeral.

110
08:47.440 --> 08:48.340
If you actually die,

111
08:48.360 --> 08:51.070
I'll go find you at the river and beat your ass, just so you know.

112
08:59.010 --> 09:01.520
View told me that your fave completely blasted you?

113
09:05.070 --> 09:05.760
Mm...

114
09:07.360 --> 09:08.980
That guy called me up there to talk,

115
09:09.000 --> 09:10.720
telling me I stole Third

116
09:10.890 --> 09:12.620
and everything that belonged to him.

117
09:13.770 --> 09:15.480
Then he jumped off,

118
09:15.500 --> 09:17.040
acting like I was the one who shoved him.

119
09:17.300 --> 09:19.960
Fuck... I was flabbergasted, to say the least.

120
09:22.560 --> 09:23.600
Foul fucking habit!

121
09:27.680 --> 09:29.780
I meant... a habit that cannot be corrected,

122
09:29.800 --> 09:31.880
ingrained through upbringing.

123
09:34.260 --> 09:35.960
Girl, that's even more brutal.

124
09:36.200 --> 09:36.940
He's right.

125
09:38.410 --> 09:40.850
Hey, but stop thinking about other things for now.

126
09:40.870 --> 09:43.280
We have to figure out what to tell

127
09:43.370 --> 09:45.280
the netizens and the fans if this gets leaked.

128
09:46.190 --> 09:47.760
I think we have to see how things go

129
09:47.780 --> 09:49.080
and how the game unfolds.

130
09:50.090 --> 09:50.800
True.

131
09:51.040 --> 09:52.950
Maybe nothing's even been leaked yet.

132
09:53.460 --> 09:54.400
Then...

133
10:00.660 --> 10:01.880
I'm going home.

134
10:01.900 --> 10:02.470
Peace out.

135
10:02.490 --> 10:03.080
Huh?!

136
10:03.640 --> 10:05.500
My man, please take care of my friend.

137
10:05.520 --> 10:06.320
Sure.

138
10:06.760 --> 10:07.320
Wait!

139
10:09.480 --> 10:10.440
Take the trash out.

140
10:11.100 --> 10:13.820
Ugh, why won't you do it yourself?!

141
10:19.950 --> 10:21.200
Fugly bitch!

142
10:21.250 --> 10:22.120
What...

143
10:30.900 --> 10:33.120
Shouldn't you head home as well?

144
10:43.570 --> 10:44.600
Don't...

145
10:44.950 --> 10:45.920
Go home.

146
10:49.520 --> 10:50.280
Uh...

147
10:51.160 --> 10:52.940
Please, you angelic gentleman.

148
10:53.470 --> 10:55.440
This is indeed my true self,

149
10:55.460 --> 10:56.440
not what you saw earlier.

150
10:56.760 --> 10:58.240
Please come back next time.

151
11:15.540 --> 11:16.520
Hold up!

152
11:17.260 --> 11:18.460
What's up with you and Third?

153
11:18.480 --> 11:19.200
Spill.

154
11:31.550 --> 11:32.640
Ugh...

155
11:33.590 --> 11:34.350
I'm sleepy.

156
11:34.380 --> 11:35.420
I'm going to bed.

157
11:37.260 --> 11:39.610
I don't mind if you like someone

158
11:39.630 --> 11:41.280
or if someone likes you,

159
11:41.860 --> 11:43.480
but you have to keep your head,

160
11:43.500 --> 11:46.030
'cause what's happening now isn't just some joke anymore.

161
11:46.440 --> 11:48.680
You know how fandoms are.

162
11:50.990 --> 11:53.160
I want my brother to be happy, of course.

163
11:53.630 --> 11:54.880
But we've gotta carefully figure out

164
11:54.900 --> 11:56.530
what to do so you don't end up getting hurt,

165
11:56.550 --> 11:57.400
okay?

166
12:02.770 --> 12:03.470
Ugh!

167
12:04.590 --> 12:06.000
What the hell is this?

168
12:06.020 --> 12:07.080
This is a fucking rollercoaster.

169
12:07.750 --> 12:09.270
Ugh, what the hell?!

170
12:21.220 --> 12:24.220
[You've been away, no pics and no updates about Nine for so long;

171
12:24.240 --> 12:27.480
we're still waiting]

172
12:28.160 --> 12:31.040
[onetonine]

173
12:31.070 --> 12:34.520
[onetonine]

174
12:37.000 --> 12:41.560
[onetonine (Rest)]

175
12:41.640 --> 12:45.040
[onetonine (Rest)]

176
12:47.470 --> 12:48.320
Yeah...

177
12:48.970 --> 12:50.500
what the hell is this?

178
12:52.460 --> 12:53.980
A fucking emotional rollercoaster.

179
13:01.660 --> 13:02.900
Did you do it?

180
13:09.760 --> 13:11.400
Tell me the truth.

181
13:11.800 --> 13:13.640
Whether you did it or not, I'll still help.

182
13:17.920 --> 13:19.400
I really got into a fight with Nine,

183
13:20.460 --> 13:22.060
but I didn't push him.

184
13:22.240 --> 13:23.840
He jumped into the pool himself.

185
13:26.280 --> 13:27.800
You jumped into the pool, Nine?

186
13:28.650 --> 13:30.000
You're doing things like this again.

187
13:30.020 --> 13:31.260
The fuck is wrong with you?!

188
13:31.280 --> 13:32.460
Why do you like causing trouble?

189
13:32.480 --> 13:33.480
It's not that I like it.

190
13:33.500 --> 13:34.880
I'm just protecting myself.

191
13:34.910 --> 13:36.120
Protecting yourself how?

192
13:36.140 --> 13:38.440
Would it be worth it if something happened to you?

193
13:38.470 --> 13:40.240
Well, my emotions took over.

194
13:40.260 --> 13:42.060
He got into a car and fucking went out to eat with Third.

195
13:42.350 --> 13:43.280
Who could've tolerated it?

196
13:43.440 --> 13:45.040
And about you going out to eat with Third?

197
13:50.260 --> 13:52.080
I was the one who told him he could go.

198
13:53.960 --> 13:56.120
They finished work at the same time, heading in the same direction.

199
13:56.140 --> 13:57.280
Let him answer.

200
14:00.970 --> 14:03.040
That day, I really went with Third.

201
14:03.320 --> 14:05.680
He asked me to grab some food with him, so I agreed.

202
14:05.700 --> 14:07.400
Then he gave me a ride to the condo.

203
14:07.570 --> 14:09.960
The PR spent all night setting the record straight.

204
14:10.040 --> 14:11.480
Good thing it didn't turn into a big deal.

205
14:13.870 --> 14:15.520
Since you've already gone the extra mile,

206
14:15.760 --> 14:17.400
you might as well put it to good use.

207
14:17.970 --> 14:20.260
Heaven knows how much Pitch has lobbied the journalists.

208
14:20.280 --> 14:22.520
I think he's trying to get rid of you.

209
14:22.850 --> 14:24.960
We need a plan to handle him.

210
14:25.840 --> 14:26.880
How?

211
14:28.240 --> 14:29.040
Pitch,

212
14:29.370 --> 14:30.640
if this escalates

213
14:30.880 --> 14:32.400
and people find out it's a lie...

214
14:32.670 --> 14:34.030
It's a filming set.

215
14:34.050 --> 14:35.280
Someone's gotta have seen something.

216
14:35.430 --> 14:37.360
We have to look for any proof there is

217
14:37.560 --> 14:39.030
to contradict what happened.

218
14:39.050 --> 14:40.280
First, stop lecturing me.

219
14:41.160 --> 14:43.520
But why do you and Nine wanna get rid of that kid so badly?

220
14:43.660 --> 14:45.320
You're starting to lose me here.

221
14:46.560 --> 14:47.640
Listen to me.

222
14:48.260 --> 14:49.960
To me, nevertheless,

223
14:50.170 --> 14:51.920
Wan is not the problem.

224
14:53.180 --> 14:55.000
But I will drive 'Our House'

225
14:55.410 --> 14:57.040
out of the industry entirely.

226
14:57.420 --> 14:59.040
Cher, hurry and find proof.

227
15:00.960 --> 15:02.000
As for you, Wan...

228
15:05.770 --> 15:07.760
Is there anything else I should worry about?

229
15:11.320 --> 15:12.120
Spit it!

230
15:14.890 --> 15:16.040
Nothing else.

231
15:16.690 --> 15:17.890
Are you sure?

232
15:22.400 --> 15:23.080
Yes.

233
15:23.240 --> 15:26.160
Right now, they've stolen too much of our client base.

234
15:26.860 --> 15:28.170
I've already told you,

235
15:28.710 --> 15:30.450
whenever there's a scandal,

236
15:30.860 --> 15:32.400
you have to crush him.

237
15:33.570 --> 15:35.040
You've heard everything, right?

238
15:35.570 --> 15:37.240
I'm not gonna let it slide this time.

239
15:37.570 --> 15:38.910
Hey... Hey, calm down.

240
15:38.930 --> 15:40.080
I don't think I can,

241
15:40.470 --> 15:42.040
because you never dealt with it for me.

242
15:42.360 --> 15:43.930
I put too much trust in you with this.

243
15:43.950 --> 15:44.740
Hey,

244
15:45.280 --> 15:47.760
everyone's just trying to do their job here.

245
15:47.960 --> 15:50.320
I already told you this was just an accident!

246
15:50.340 --> 15:51.840
Oh, okay.

247
15:53.530 --> 15:55.680
I guess there's no point talking to you anymore,

248
15:55.950 --> 15:58.160
so I'm gonna handle this my way.

249
15:58.300 --> 15:59.160
So that's settled?

250
16:17.260 --> 16:18.550
I'm just here to give you a warning,

251
16:19.560 --> 16:21.980
but if you still can't get your boyfriend under control,

252
16:23.290 --> 16:24.590
this won't be the end of it.

253
17:04.920 --> 17:06.160
Aren't you gonna say something?

254
17:07.869 --> 17:09.240
What are you doing, Third?

255
17:12.210 --> 17:13.040
Huh?

256
17:13.160 --> 17:15.750
Threatening the producer of the series you're starring in?

257
17:16.579 --> 17:17.490
Seriously?

258
17:17.900 --> 17:19.210
I'm not threatening you.

259
17:20.819 --> 17:24.300
But if you still think you have the upper hand on me,

260
17:24.869 --> 17:25.980
try me,

261
17:27.760 --> 17:29.480
because if I get to use this video,

262
17:30.570 --> 17:31.620
I'll use it real good.

263
17:31.640 --> 17:32.880
Weird...

264
17:32.900 --> 17:33.840
You and Wan.

265
17:35.500 --> 17:37.340
Typically, someone like your damn self

266
17:38.470 --> 17:40.560
doesn't help anyone so easily, no?

267
17:42.770 --> 17:44.320
Just don't let me find out.

268
17:44.950 --> 17:47.280
Whatever you're doing, hide it nice and well.

269
17:52.690 --> 17:54.200
Don't worry about me.

270
17:54.760 --> 17:56.280
Go handle Nine.

271
18:02.180 --> 18:03.460
Or can't you?

272
18:46.100 --> 18:46.920
Brother,

273
18:51.540 --> 18:53.240
Third already showed you the video, right?

274
18:57.690 --> 18:58.760
That was from me.

275
19:02.120 --> 19:04.640
You're probably thinking why I'm doing this.

276
19:06.560 --> 19:07.400
Good question.

277
19:08.360 --> 19:09.760
I'm wondering that myself.

278
19:10.760 --> 19:12.120
Just spit it.

279
19:12.270 --> 19:13.080
What the hell do you want?

280
19:14.400 --> 19:15.650
Save that for later...

281
19:16.690 --> 19:17.680
Ugh!

282
19:17.950 --> 19:19.430
Why are you hushing it up?

283
19:19.450 --> 19:21.520
Why the fuck are you hemming and hawing?!

284
19:21.540 --> 19:24.040
You wanted to act in this series, I let you.

285
19:24.060 --> 19:26.910
You wanted Time in it, I found him a role.

286
19:26.930 --> 19:27.500
Just say

287
19:27.520 --> 19:29.360
what the hell you want, straight up.

288
19:29.660 --> 19:32.000
This isn't a playground for you to play around in.

289
19:33.660 --> 19:35.640
Or maybe it is...

290
19:41.980 --> 19:43.760
What the fuck do you want from me?

291
19:44.890 --> 19:47.420
Just bear with me and play along.

292
19:47.440 --> 19:48.220
Consider it...

293
19:48.240 --> 19:51.440
my payback for how you always flicked my ears when I was small.

294
19:59.540 --> 20:00.520
You want some of this?

295
20:01.040 --> 20:01.780
Go ahead,

296
20:03.560 --> 20:05.030
but I'm leaking it...

297
20:22.340 --> 20:23.860
'Under the Star's Table' hasn't posted about it, right?

298
20:25.360 --> 20:26.440
Now, check 'Ejam Entertain,' too.

299
20:26.460 --> 20:27.880
That news page is quick to act.

300
20:29.440 --> 20:30.860
And make sure they haven't.

301
20:53.190 --> 20:55.000
Everyone, go back to work for now.

302
20:55.410 --> 20:56.850
Get out of this zone.

303
20:58.450 --> 20:59.640
I'll handle this.

304
21:07.580 --> 21:08.480
Why are you here?

305
21:11.050 --> 21:13.600
Well, I'm here to see you, my friend.

306
21:14.690 --> 21:15.460
What do you want?

307
21:15.480 --> 21:16.480
Just say it.

308
21:17.740 --> 21:20.200
Well, the kid wouldn't take responsibility,

309
21:21.070 --> 21:22.640
but the company...

310
21:22.660 --> 21:24.840
can't run away from it.

311
21:30.520 --> 21:31.870
I have the receipt.

312
21:35.600 --> 21:36.560
What receipt?

313
21:37.370 --> 21:38.440
The same one I have?

314
21:39.260 --> 21:40.760
If you wanna take action against us,

315
21:41.050 --> 21:42.560
then please take it to court,

316
21:42.860 --> 21:44.520
but you have to be sure

317
21:44.710 --> 21:46.160
that you won't lose the case.

318
21:46.350 --> 21:47.760
Better have your money ready.

319
21:48.750 --> 21:50.240
How much are you looking for?

320
21:50.760 --> 21:52.210
It's just that, lately...

321
21:52.230 --> 21:53.760
we're overloaded with new clients,

322
21:54.430 --> 21:57.200
ones that happened to be taken from you.

323
