I need to have a word with Nine.

647
38:05.940 --> 38:06.940
Always like this.

648
38:18.850 --> 38:20.180
You and I,

649
38:20.200 --> 38:21.600
we'll talk things out.

650
38:23.650 --> 38:25.400
I'm sorry about last time.

651
38:25.560 --> 38:26.860
I got too worked up.

652
38:27.640 --> 38:28.920
I just wanted the truth.

653
38:30.460 --> 38:31.750
Can you help me with this one first?

654
38:33.060 --> 38:34.760
Third has a video of me falling into the pool.

655
38:35.450 --> 38:36.160
Huh?

656
38:36.850 --> 38:37.660
How could he have it?

657
38:37.680 --> 38:39.160
Renji recorded it,

658
38:40.220 --> 38:42.360
but North already told me he'd take care of him.

659
38:44.350 --> 38:45.450
We're fucked.

660
38:46.440 --> 38:48.250
Last time, there was no security camera footage,

661
38:48.640 --> 38:50.440
but this time, there is.

662
38:51.500 --> 38:53.080
But can you just help me fix this?

663
38:56.070 --> 38:57.960
Then tell me the truth.

664
39:02.180 --> 39:02.920
Well...

665
39:03.550 --> 39:05.270
We got into a fight, and he dared me to do it.

666
39:05.290 --> 39:07.040
I just let myself fall, and that was it.

667
39:08.910 --> 39:10.540
Haven't I told you to get a grip?!

668
39:10.560 --> 39:12.650
You always act like a stupid villain in a soap opera.

669
39:12.680 --> 39:14.760
But I never said I was shoved, did I?

670
39:15.050 --> 39:16.360
You said it.

671
39:16.850 --> 39:17.640
Right,

672
39:17.850 --> 39:19.400
this Sunny bitch just jumped the gun.

673
39:21.500 --> 39:22.560
How about this?

674
39:23.030 --> 39:25.520
I think you should find a way to talk to Third.

675
39:25.970 --> 39:26.970
Talk it out nicely.

676
39:27.670 --> 39:28.860
Give in to him a bit.

677
39:31.350 --> 39:32.760
Will he ever listen to me?

678
39:34.360 --> 39:36.180
Third isn't that bad of a person.

679
39:37.470 --> 39:39.130
Go admit to him that you were the one

680
39:39.150 --> 39:40.640
who jumped into the pool yourself.

681
39:42.030 --> 39:44.080
If you want his help with this,

682
39:44.390 --> 39:46.840
you have to clear the air about you guys' past,

683
39:47.100 --> 39:48.870
not keep fighting like you are now.

684
39:52.850 --> 39:54.000
You're all grown-ups.

685
39:54.690 --> 39:56.940
At least, you were friends, weren't you?

686
39:57.610 --> 39:58.610
I think you can do it.

687
40:09.210 --> 40:10.140
Wanna talk now?

688
40:11.260 --> 40:12.080
He's already here.

689
40:18.400 --> 40:20.200
I have nothing to say to a piece of shit like him.

690
40:24.000 --> 40:24.920
I'll be back.

691
40:26.120 --> 40:26.760
Third.

692
40:33.560 --> 40:34.500
All done?

693
40:34.520 --> 40:36.800
I'll touch up your face so you can hurry back to work.

694
40:40.600 --> 40:42.000
This shade is perfect for your skin.

695
40:43.180 --> 40:43.870
Third!

696
40:45.660 --> 40:46.320
Third!

697
40:47.000 --> 40:48.360
How many times do I have to say it?

698
40:48.860 --> 40:50.600
How come you never listen when I warn you?

699
40:51.180 --> 40:52.390
How are you gonna work together?

700
40:52.410 --> 40:53.520
How about you go warn Nine?

701
40:53.690 --> 40:54.900
Why is it always me?!

702
40:56.180 --> 40:58.040
Don't let your emotions take over, Third.

703
41:01.090 --> 41:03.340
I know you might not be happy with this.

704
41:03.370 --> 41:05.240
Do you know that by saying all this,

705
41:06.210 --> 41:07.750
you're taking Nine's side?

706
41:12.270 --> 41:14.600
This argument is never gonna end today.

707
41:15.720 --> 41:16.880
Just do me a favor.

708
41:17.770 --> 41:19.860
I know how Nine is.

709
41:20.370 --> 41:21.760
I already warned him

710
41:22.020 --> 41:23.110
about the pool incident for you.

711
41:23.130 --> 41:24.080
You sure you did?

712
41:24.870 --> 41:26.850
Mm, I did warn him.

713
41:27.190 --> 41:28.760
I did what I could.

714
41:29.260 --> 41:31.040
I'm the one taking care of you both.

715
41:31.290 --> 41:33.720
If I can't warn either of you, I'll have to quit my job, Third.

716
41:36.410 --> 41:38.050
What you did during the break this morning,

717
41:38.070 --> 41:39.020
I saw it.

718
41:42.810 --> 41:44.000
But I won't interfere.

719
41:44.610 --> 41:45.840
Whatever you do,

720
41:46.030 --> 41:47.320
think it through,

721
41:48.400 --> 41:50.150
or it'll come back to haunt me,

722
41:50.170 --> 41:51.360
you,

723
41:51.380 --> 41:52.080
Pitch,

724
41:53.740 --> 41:54.920
and even Wan.

725
41:56.070 --> 41:57.480
Do you understand what I'm saying?

726
42:02.040 --> 42:03.080
Talk it out.

727
42:21.500 --> 42:22.910
So this is...

728
42:23.520 --> 42:25.780
- crispy pork belly? - Hurry up and eat, sweeties,

729
42:25.800 --> 42:27.390
so we can continue shooting.

730
42:27.410 --> 42:29.250
Hurry up, or we'll miss the natural light.

731
42:29.280 --> 42:29.960
- Oh? - By the way...

732
42:30.040 --> 42:31.590
- What? - He was kinda killing it.

733
42:31.620 --> 42:33.310
- Why? - That little Winsome Wan.

734
42:33.330 --> 42:34.650
He could play nice,

735
42:34.670 --> 42:36.420
but when he has to be absolutely evil...

736
42:36.440 --> 42:38.280
he's the worst villain!

737
42:38.620 --> 42:39.400
True.

738
42:39.930 --> 42:41.840
Bitch, what a fucking ass, right?

739
42:44.940 --> 42:45.840
Secretly an ass.

740
42:45.870 --> 42:47.040
Hey, good for him, though.

741
42:47.270 --> 42:49.460
What perfect casting for this character.

742
42:49.480 --> 42:50.350
It's gonna be an easy job.

743
42:50.370 --> 42:51.520
Yeah, fabulous!

744
42:51.700 --> 42:54.560
Don't you think some are being absolute cringelords, Toto?

745
42:58.110 --> 43:00.560
Blabbing as though their brains reject sensible thoughts.

746
43:01.400 --> 43:02.010
Rin.

747
43:02.030 --> 43:04.250
- Hm? - Call "911."

748
43:04.280 --> 43:05.880
Notify the police.

749
43:06.300 --> 43:08.250
I'm thinking two or three cases.

750
43:08.270 --> 43:08.800
Ooh!

751
43:08.880 --> 43:10.250
There are multiple cases, girl?

752
43:10.280 --> 43:11.960
I'm talking about that sasaeng we caught.

753
43:12.210 --> 43:13.130
- Oh... - Yeah, that bitch.

754
43:13.160 --> 43:14.770
A real troublemaker.

755
43:14.800 --> 43:16.360
- He's actually... - Whoa!

756
43:18.700 --> 43:19.790
The fuck is wrong with you?

757
43:20.620 --> 43:22.560
It just slipped out of my hand, Queen. Sorry.

758
43:22.890 --> 43:25.260
Seeing how you queens are mid-gossip sesh,

759
43:25.280 --> 43:27.560
I thought I should chuck you some fucking food

760
43:27.580 --> 43:29.520
in case you'll shut up while stuffing your face.

761
43:30.190 --> 43:31.610
Thank you for your concern.

762
43:32.510 --> 43:33.740
See that over there?

763
43:34.040 --> 43:35.010
A dog bowl!

764
43:35.040 --> 43:36.400
- Come on, I'll lead you to your food! - Ow!

765
43:44.120 --> 43:45.780
So realistic.

766
43:46.730 --> 43:48.080
Whose side are you on, huh?

767
43:48.320 --> 43:49.280
- Look, look, look. - Don't grab me!

768
43:50.300 --> 43:51.860
- These bitches, you play... - Why are you grabbing me?!

769
43:51.880 --> 43:54.720
Of course, I'm taking the winner's side.

770
43:56.010 --> 43:57.020
- Wanna turn that into a TV drama? - Let go! Ugh!

771
43:57.040 --> 43:57.690
You think I fucking would?!

772
43:57.710 --> 43:58.500
A new series?

773
43:58.520 --> 43:59.890
- Let go, let go! - Argh!

774
43:59.910 --> 44:00.820
Let go of my girl first!

775
44:00.840 --> 44:01.680
No fucking way!

776
44:01.760 --> 44:02.640
I can't take this anymore.

777
44:04.390 --> 44:05.880
Hey, stop!

778
44:05.900 --> 44:06.760
Ugh!

779
44:06.840 --> 44:08.570
Did you come straight out of '4 Kings'?!

780
44:08.590 --> 44:09.560
The hell are you doing?!

781
44:09.880 --> 44:11.200
- Just goofing around. - Exactly.

782
44:11.440 --> 44:12.520
- Goofing... Goofing? - Goofing around.

783
44:12.540 --> 44:14.280
Good job, let's not do that again.

784
44:14.300 --> 44:17.560
Our set does not condone violence, you see.

785
44:17.600 --> 44:18.850
Non-violence.

786
44:18.880 --> 44:20.000
We're just messing around.

787
44:20.020 --> 44:21.020
Just playing.

788
44:21.040 --> 44:21.710
We are.

789
44:21.730 --> 44:23.560
We're just playing, nothing serious.

790
44:23.580 --> 44:24.700
Say it. "We're just playing."

791
44:24.720 --> 44:26.120
- That's true. - We're just playing.

792
44:27.010 --> 44:28.010
- Yes. - Yes.

793
44:28.040 --> 44:29.030
Bitch, let go.

794
44:29.050 --> 44:29.820
You let go!

795
44:29.840 --> 44:31.360
- Bitch, let go of me! - You let go!

796
44:31.710 --> 44:33.600
- Three, two, one! - Three, two, one!

797
44:35.560 --> 44:36.540
You, too!

798
44:37.260 --> 44:38.320
Why didn't you say so?!

799
44:39.460 --> 44:40.760
Bitch, they're already done playing!

800
44:41.170 --> 44:42.720
Who could've fought your gargantuan self?!

801
44:42.740 --> 44:44.360
Wow... Bastard!

802
44:44.380 --> 44:45.070
Alright, Ant-Man!

803
44:45.090 --> 44:46.640
As if you're so small, bitch!

804
44:46.680 --> 44:47.770
Go eat your fucking food!

805
44:47.790 --> 44:48.840
Always fighting and shit.

806
44:49.110 --> 44:51.160
- Stuff your fucking face, bitch. - You started it.

807
44:51.540 --> 44:53.340
You pushed my buttons, you little brat.

808
44:53.360 --> 44:54.060
Motherfucker.

809
44:54.080 --> 44:55.600
Hey, that's enough!

810
44:56.310 --> 44:58.280
We're just joking around!

811
45:54.260 --> 45:55.240
How did you get up here?

812
45:56.310 --> 45:58.630
Everyone in this country knows we're an on-screen couple,

813
45:59.130 --> 46:00.240
so they let me up here.

814
46:02.600 --> 46:03.600
I'll get to the point.

815
46:05.470 --> 46:07.000
Why haven't you leaked the video?

816
46:14.520 --> 46:15.940
I said, "Why haven't you leaked the video?"

817
46:15.960 --> 46:17.280
Well, do you want me to?

818
46:21.860 --> 46:22.680
Thank you.

819
46:25.360 --> 46:26.600
Why are you thanking me?

820
46:27.290 --> 46:28.470
I'm not doing this as a favor.

821
46:28.850 --> 46:29.720
Are we done?

822
46:30.090 --> 46:31.590
I have nothing to say to you.

823
46:35.130 --> 46:37.920
Don't you seriously wanna know why I did that to Wan?

824
46:41.940 --> 46:43.510
Wanna keep having this talk right here?

825
47:17.440 --> 47:18.580
Say what you have to say.

826
47:24.230 --> 47:25.480
The reason I did it

827
47:26.720 --> 47:27.960
is that I don't like Wan.

828
47:29.700 --> 47:30.880
He stole my gigs

829
47:32.690 --> 47:34.750
and you, my partner.

830
47:38.880 --> 47:39.830
I don't give a shit

831
47:39.850 --> 47:41.280
about what goes down between you two.

832
47:43.320 --> 47:45.600
But right now, you're letting the whole world know.

833
47:46.130 --> 47:47.190
Who's gonna be screwed?

834
47:47.390 --> 47:48.720
Not just you and that boy,

835
47:49.400 --> 47:50.560
but me too.

836
47:52.650 --> 47:54.040
And you want me to do nothing, Third?

837
47:55.400 --> 47:56.520
But you do know

838
47:57.780 --> 47:59.640
how hard it's been for me

839
48:00.510 --> 48:01.300
to get to where I am.

840
48:01.320 --> 48:02.760
So did you have to take it that far?

841
48:03.580 --> 48:04.180
Huh?

842
48:04.840 --> 48:06.150
You tried to drown Wan.

843
48:06.930 --> 48:08.700
You made people think he shoved you.

844
48:08.720 --> 48:09.780
He deserved it.

845
48:15.440 --> 48:16.800
I have to protect myself.

846
48:18.950 --> 48:20.600
You don't have to take my side.

847
48:27.050 --> 48:28.240
But I'm begging you.

848
48:31.760 --> 48:33.240
Could you not leak the video?

849
48:34.480 --> 48:36.400
Why on earth should I listen to you?

850
48:42.200 --> 48:43.840
Because if you were really gonna expose me,

851
48:45.900 --> 48:47.360
you would've done it a long time ago,

852
48:49.260 --> 48:50.920
not waiting around for this damn video.

853
48:52.760 --> 48:53.440
Am I right?

854
49:03.720 --> 49:04.330
Miss,

855
49:04.350 --> 49:05.350
I'll help you.

856
49:05.550 --> 49:07.130
Oh, thank you.

857
49:07.480 --> 49:08.550
- You're welcome. - I'll help you, too.

858
49:08.570 --> 49:09.680
Here, here, here.

859
49:12.340 --> 49:13.760
Are you guys still not going home?

860
49:14.030 --> 49:15.650
Oh, I'm about to, Miss.

861
49:15.670 --> 49:17.760
Then, I'll walk you to your car.

862
49:17.800 --> 49:19.440
- Alright, sure. Come on. - Alright.

863
49:27.550 --> 49:28.720
This is pretty heavy, Miss.

864
49:30.150 --> 49:31.640
Thank you so much, Nopphanat.

865
49:31.780 --> 49:33.020
- You too, Tharit. - Of course.

866
49:33.040 --> 49:34.580
Here, put it in the trunk.

867
49:34.600 --> 49:35.800
Alright, sure thing.

868
49:43.800 --> 49:44.840
Don't forget to eat, Miss.

869
49:44.870 --> 49:46.520
Mm, thanks.

870
49:47.920 --> 49:49.130
Uh... Miss?

871
49:49.560 --> 49:51.730
If there's anything I can help with, please tell me.

872
49:51.760 --> 49:52.830
Wow, I'd love that.

873
49:52.850 --> 49:53.760
Thanks so much.

874
49:53.780 --> 49:54.910
- Of course. - Hey, are you two

875
49:54.930 --> 49:56.010
heading home together?

876
49:56.790 --> 49:57.730
Oh, no.

877
49:57.750 --> 49:59.140
I'm heading back, Miss.

878
49:59.160 --> 50:00.480
- Goodbye. - Goodbye.

879
50:00.520 --> 50:01.160
- Goodbye. - Goodbye.

880
50:01.180 --> 50:02.080
Thanks.

881
50:05.800 --> 50:08.110
Has everyone received their exam papers?

882
50:08.460 --> 50:09.580
If you're ready...

883
50:09.600 --> 50:10.760
you may open your exam paper.

884
50:16.840 --> 50:17.400
Uh...

885
50:17.600 --> 50:18.400
Miss?

886
50:20.770 --> 50:21.840
So...

887
50:21.950 --> 50:24.840
I saw a copy of this exam in Tharit's backpack.

888
50:26.000 --> 50:27.120
What are you saying?

889
50:27.880 --> 50:29.220
Actually, I might've just imagined it.

890
50:29.240 --> 50:31.240
It's probably not what happened.

891
50:31.660 --> 50:32.600
I'm sorry.

892
50:45.050 --> 50:45.780
Tharit,

893
50:46.890 --> 50:48.120
come with me outside.

894
50:50.060 --> 50:50.720
Alright...

895
50:56.810 --> 50:57.960
Which one is your backpack?

896
50:59.000 --> 50:59.700
That one.

897
51:12.240 --> 51:13.840
Where did you get this exam?

898
51:15.270 --> 51:16.100
I don't know,

899
51:16.120 --> 51:17.280
but that's not mine.

900
51:17.300 --> 51:18.420
If it's not,

901
51:18.440 --> 51:20.600
then how did it end up in your backpack?

902
51:20.780 --> 51:22.600
What blatant evidence.

903
51:23.240 --> 51:24.870
Did you steal a copy of mine

904
51:24.890 --> 51:26.800
the day you gave me a hand with my stuff?

905
51:27.490 --> 51:28.240
Tharit...

906
51:29.350 --> 51:30.820
you're disqualified from taking the exam.

907
52:09.940 --> 52:10.840
Shit...

908
52:34.660 --> 52:36.500
[Scholarship exam for the United States Exchange Student Program,

909
52:36.520 --> 52:38.680
Grade 12, Krungthep Udomwit School]

910
52:38.700 --> 52:39.660
Don't forget to eat, Miss.

911
52:39.680 --> 52:41.440
Mm, thanks.

912
52:59.720 --> 53:01.120
I checked the security footage.

913
53:01.980 --> 53:02.920
Come with me.

914
53:07.950 --> 53:09.320
Why did you do it, Nine?

915
53:12.690 --> 53:13.640
You're better than me.

916
53:16.290 --> 53:17.560
I have to survive, don't I?

917
53:18.170 --> 53:19.440
Even if it's you, I have to do it.

918
53:22.160 --> 53:23.360
Is this who you truly are?

919
53:25.570 --> 53:26.280
Yeah,

920
53:26.960 --> 53:28.080
this is who I am.

921
53:30.320 --> 53:31.720
Actually, I have to thank you.

922
53:31.740 --> 53:33.560
Because of you, I got the first look at the exam.

923
53:34.040 --> 53:36.240
I think I only faked getting...

924
53:37.840 --> 53:38.930
two questions wrong.

925
53:40.500 --> 53:42.040
I wanna thank you for...

926
53:42.460 --> 53:43.960
not exposing me back then.

927
53:44.290 --> 53:45.400
Don't flatter yourself.

928
53:46.820 --> 53:48.800
And don't you talk about the past.

929
53:49.020 --> 53:50.480
We're long past that,

930
53:51.370 --> 53:53.640
and you're fucking nothing to me.

931
53:55.270 --> 53:56.360
Nothing.

932
53:56.960 --> 53:58.040
You wanna know

933
53:58.910 --> 54:00.240
why I'm not leaking the video?

934
54:00.750 --> 54:02.800
Because this involves far too many people.

935
54:04.200 --> 54:06.600
I don't wanna do something that I'd regret later on.

936
54:07.080 --> 54:08.080
But you do know

937
54:09.010 --> 54:10.720
if you leak it, it'll clear Wan's name.

938
54:11.120 --> 54:12.840
But the ones who'll be screwed the most

939
54:12.960 --> 54:13.800
are you,

940
54:13.820 --> 54:14.620
me,

941
54:14.640 --> 54:15.440
Sunny,

942
54:15.460 --> 54:16.280
Pitch,

943
54:16.540 --> 54:17.350
and your mom!

944
54:17.370 --> 54:18.920
And what the fuck's your deal, bastard?!

945
54:18.940 --> 54:19.480
Huh?!

946
54:19.740 --> 54:20.920
You always use my mom to threaten me.

947
54:20.940 --> 54:22.200
Because the beginning of it all

948
54:22.370 --> 54:24.400
was that you were scared of your mom.

949
54:24.720 --> 54:26.400
That's how all this fucking shit

950
54:26.770 --> 54:28.210
happened in the first place, Third!

951
54:28.230 --> 54:29.600
Why not blame yourself for once?

952
54:29.700 --> 54:31.540
All the shit happening to you,

953
54:31.560 --> 54:33.160
you've done it all to yourself.

954
54:39.550 --> 54:40.640
Post it, then.

955
54:46.260 --> 54:47.480
Screw us all to hell.

956
54:49.190 --> 54:49.880
Go on.

957
55:09.140 --> 55:09.800
What's the matter?

958
55:13.820 --> 55:14.640
Hesitating?

959
55:57.060 --> 55:58.520
Why hesitate? Post it!

960
56:00.650 --> 56:01.360
Third,

961
56:01.860 --> 56:03.280
did you apply for the scholarship?

962
56:03.760 --> 56:05.200
The teacher told me.

963
56:05.760 --> 56:07.320
How could you do this to me, asshole?!

964
56:08.150 --> 56:09.640
I think my mom applied for it for me.

965
56:10.700 --> 56:13.160
Third, you know how hard I've been working for this.

966
56:13.850 --> 56:16.680
